{'symbol': 'EQR', 'date': '2021-12-16 16:15:00', 'title': 'EQUITY RESIDENTIAL DECLARES FOURTH QUARTER DIVIDENDS', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EQUITY RESIDENTIAL (NYSE: EQR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF TRUSTEES DECLARED QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON AND PREFERRED SHARES. A REGULAR COMMON SHARE DIVIDEND FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF $0.6025 PER SHARE WILL BE PAID ON JANUARY 14, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JANUARY 3, 2022. A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.03625 PER SHARE WILL BE PAID ON DECEMBER 31, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 21, 2021 OF THE COMPANY'S SERIES K PREFERRED SHARES. A"}